# Nothing is required to run the panel.
#
# There is deliberately no variable for the API's address: the bundle calls
# /api/... relative and must contain no host, port or scheme, because the API
# serves no CORS headers. The deployed container chooses its upstream with
# API_UPSTREAM (see DEPLOY.md), which nginx reads at startup.
#
# API_UPSTREAM is also honoured by the Vite dev server's /api proxy, so
# `npm run dev` in live mode can reach a real backend. It is read in Node by
# vite.config.ts and never reaches the bundle.
#
# API_UPSTREAM=http://127.0.0.1:18000
